      "source": "https://www.newarkhistoryde.com/visit"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Newark College was chartered in 1833, later renamed Delaware College, and now serves as the University of Delaware.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://newarkde.gov/56/History-of-Newark"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The University of Delaware grew from a private academy that became Newark’s largest landowner, steering the city’s growth.",
